      "reviews": "“Intriguing mystical plot; a combination of the eerie atmosphere of urban legends, post-Soviet romance and fantasy in the spirit of the Strugatsky brothers; not very colorful, but lively and honest characters; great work with sound and music works perfectly for the atmosphere.”<br>Похвально – Stopgame<br><br>“This &quot;Call&quot; in the circumstances of &quot;Silent hill&quot; with the flavor of &quot;Stalker&quot; Strugatsky and &quot;Solaris&quot; Lem perfectly reflects the spirit of the times.”<br>KATABASIA<br><br>“Recommended for all lovers of horror movies who have played hide and seek at least a couple of times and know how to build a real military headquarters from branches and fittings.”<br>Достойно – Игромания<br>",
